    {
      "source": "Delegates <a href=\"RepositoryFactorySupport.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.core.support\"><code>RepositoryFactorySupport</code></a> creation to <a href=\"#doCreateRepositoryFactory()\"><code>doCreateRepositoryFactory()</code></a> and applies the\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/core/support/TransactionalRepositoryProxyPostProcessor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository.core.support\"><code>TransactionalRepositoryProxyPostProcessor</code></a> to the created instance.",
      "translation": "将委托给 <a href=\"RepositoryFactorySupport.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.core.support\"><code>RepositoryFactorySupport</code></a> 创建 <a href=\"#doCreateRepositoryFactory()\"><code>doCreateRepositoryFactory()</code></a>，并将 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/core/support/TransactionalRepositoryProxyPostProcessor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository.core.support\"><code>TransactionalRepositoryProxyPostProcessor</code></a> 应用于创建的实例。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"TransactionalRepositoryFactoryBeanSupport.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.core.support\"><code>TransactionalRepositoryFactoryBeanSupport</code></a> for the given repository interface.",
      "translation": "为给定的存储库接口创建一个新的<a href=\"TransactionalRepositoryFactoryBeanSupport.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.core.support\"><code>TransactionalRepositoryFactoryBeanSupport</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates the actual <a href=\"RepositoryFactorySupport.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.core.support\"><code>RepositoryFactorySupport</code></a> instance.",
      "translation": "创建实际的<a href=\"RepositoryFactorySupport.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.repository.core.support 中的类\"><code>RepositoryFactorySupport</code></a>实例。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Configures whether to enable the default transactions configured at the repository base implementation class.",
      "translation": "配置是否启用在仓库基实现类中配置的默认事务。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
