    {
      "source": "Extension of <a href=\"RepositoryFactoryBeanSupport.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.core.support\"><code>RepositoryFactoryBeanSupport</code></a> to add transactional capabilities to the repository proxy. Will\nregister a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/core/support/TransactionalRepositoryProxyPostProcessor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository.core.support\"><code>TransactionalRepositoryProxyPostProcessor</code></a> that in turn adds a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/transaction/interceptor/TransactionInterceptor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.transaction.interceptor\"><code>TransactionInterceptor</code></a> to\nthe repository proxy to be created.",
      "translation": "扩展 <a href=\"RepositoryFactoryBeanSupport.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.core.support\"><code>RepositoryFactoryBeanSupport</code></a> 以向仓库代理添加事务支持。将注册一个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/core/support/TransactionalRepositoryProxyPostProcessor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository.core.support\"><code>TransactionalRepositoryProxyPostProcessor</code></a>，该处理器进而向待创建的仓库代理添加一个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/transaction/interceptor/TransactionInterceptor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.transaction.interceptor\"><code>TransactionInterceptor</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Setter to configure which transaction manager to be used. We have to use the bean name explicitly as otherwise the\nqualifier of the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/transaction/annotation/Transactional.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.transaction.annotation\"><code>Transactional</code></a> annotation is used. By explicitly\ndefining the transaction manager bean name we favour let this one be the default one chosen.",
      "translation": "用于配置要使用的事务管理器的设置。我们必须显式使用 Bean 名称，否则将使用 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/transaction/annotation/Transactional.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.transaction.annotation\"><code>Transactional</code></a>` 注解的限定符。通过显式定义事务管理器 Bean 名称，我们倾向于让此 Bean 成为默认选择。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Setter to configure which transaction manager to be used.",
      "translation": "设置器，用于配置要使用的事务管理器。",
      "count": 1
    },
